  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following compounds, on reaction with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> gives yellow colour?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "S74M5",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "A0DK9",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Al</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dubpV",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cr</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3ZLrw",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Chromium hydroxide, i.e.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cr</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math> when reacts with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, gives yellow colour of sodium chromate. The whole reaction is as follows</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Cr</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CrO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>yellow</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>NaOH</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
